// Component names
@1 = ~Kit: Black Dragon Disciple (sorcerer)~
@2 = ~Spells: Acidosis, Rot of Ages and Ghostly Tail (level 1), Mantidrake Spike (level 2), Wyvern Barbed Tail Strike, Black Dragon Pooling Breath and Black Dragon Breathball (level 3), Stunning Black Dragon Breath (level 4), Black Dragon Animate Breath (level 7), Bonemelt (level 8)~
@3 = ~Tweak: Vitriolic Sphere, 5th edition style~

// Install messages
@10 = ~This component requires an Enhanced Edition game.~
@11 = ~Bonemelt is a level 8 spell: it is only installed on BG2:EE and EET. Acidosis, Rot of Ages, Ghostly Tail, Mantidrake Spike, Wyvern Barbed Tail Strike, Black Dragon Pooling Breath, Black Dragon Breathball, Stunning Black Dragon Breath and Black Dragon Animate Breath have been installed.~
@12 = ~Vitriolic Sphere was not found in SPELL.IDS (WIZARD_VITRIOLIC_SPHERE). Install IWDification first, or play IWD:EE.~
